        "original_id": "5dbfc8da-5fbe-51dc-a54b-51288e7939c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Crown Holdings, Crown Cork & Seal Company\n- Products: metal beverage cans, food cans, metal aerosol containers, metal closures, specialty packing\n- Concepts: canning, shelf life\n- Places: North America, Europe\n\nFacts:\n- Crown Holdings Incorporated was formerly named Crown Cork & Seal Company.\n- Crown Holdings Incorporated is an American company that makes metal beverage and food cans, metal aerosol containers, metal closures, and specialty packing.\n- Crown Holdings claims to manufacture one out of every five beverage cans used in the world.\n- Crown Holdings claims to manufacture one out of every three food cans used in North America and Europe.\n- Canning typically provides a shelf life ranging from one to five years, although under specific circumstances it can last much longer.",
